 trade charter\nSustainability","c4Title":"About Framique","c4Links":"Our story\nMedia & press\nCareers\nTerms & privacy","c1Title_bn":"কালেকশন","c2Title_bn":"গ্রাহক সেবা","c3Title_bn":"আমাদের ঐতিহ্য","c4Title_bn":"ফ্রেমিকে সম্পর্কে"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-payment-icons-61","type":"payment_icons","props":{"heading":"Payment methods","marks":"bKash\nNagad\nRocket\nVisa\nMastercard\nCash on Delivery","heading_bn":"পেমেন্ট মাধ্যম"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-social-strip-62","type":"social_strip","props":{"heading":"Follow our craft journey","heading_bn":"আমাদের কারুশিল্পের যাত্রা অনুসরণ করুন"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-rich-text-63","type":"rich_text","props":{"heading":"About Framique Heritage","body":"Celebrating Bengal''s timeless handloom traditions, empowering generational artisan families across Bangladesh.","heading_bn":"ফ্রেমিকে হেরিটেজ সম্পর্কে","body_bn":"বাংলার আবহমান তাঁত ঐতিহ্য উদযাপন এবং সারাদেশের বংশানুক্রমিক কারিগর পরিবারগুলোর ক্ষমতায়ন।"}}]},"page":{"header":[{"id":"clothing-heritage-breadcrumb-64","type":"breadcrumb","props":{"homeLabel":"Home"}}],"main":[{"id":"clothing-heritage-heritage-story-65","type":"heritage_story","props":{"eyebrow":"Our story","heading":"Preserving Bengal''s 500-year-old handloom heritage","body":"How community-led weaving clusters are empowering women artisans across rural Bangladesh.","ctaLabel":"Meet the artisans","ctaHref":"/blog/master-weavers"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-editorial-banner-66","type":"editorial_banner","props":{"eyebrow":"Our mission","heading":"","body":"Every purchase directly supports artisan families across 64 districts. No middlemen, no exploitation — just dignity and craft.","ctaLabel":"Our charter","ctaHref":"/pages/fair-trade"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-marquee-strip-67","type":"marquee_strip","props":{"label":"Handloom · Fair Trade · Artisan-Owned · Natural Dyes · Zero Plastic"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-story-trunk-68","type":"story_trunk","props":{"heading":"","t1Title":"Founded 1972","t1Body":"Born from a vision to preserve Bengal''s weaving traditions","t2Title":"65,000+ artisans","t2Body":"Rural craftspeople across 64 districts","t3Title":"Zero plastic","t3Body":"Biodegradable jute and paper packaging"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-testimonial-carousel-69","type":"testimonial_carousel","props":{"items":[{"quote":"The Jamdani saree exceeded all expectations. The texture, fall, and intricate motif work are truly world-class.","author":"Farhana Ahmed, Gulshan, Dhaka"},{"quote":"Authentic handloom quality at a fair price. My family has worn Aarong for three generations.","author":"Tanvir Rahman, Banani, Dhaka"}]}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-page-content-70","type":"page_content","props":{}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-store-locator-71","type":"store_locator","props":{"heading":"","s1Name":"Uttara Flagship","s1Address":"Sector 3, Uttara, Dhaka","s1Hours":"10am - 9pm","s2Name":"Gulshan Galleria","s2Address":"Gulshan Avenue, Dhaka","s2Hours":"10am - 9pm","s3Name":"Chattogram GEC","s3Address":"GEC Circle, Chattogram","s3Hours":"10am - 9pm","s1Name_bn":"উত্তরা ফ্ল্যাগশিপ","s1Address_bn":"সেক্টর ৩, উত্তরা, ঢাকা","s1Hours_bn":"সকাল ১০টা - রাত ৯টা","s2Name_bn":"গুলশান গ্যালারিয়া","s2Address_bn":"গুলশান অ্যাভিনিউ, ঢাকা","s2Hours_bn":"সকাল ১০টা - রাত ৯টা","s3Name_bn":"চট্টগ্রাম জিইসি","s3Address_bn":"জিইসি মোড়, চট্টগ্রাম","s3Hours_bn":"সকাল ১০টা - রাত ৯টা"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-form-72","type":"form","props":{"heading":"","body":"We''d love to hear from you. Fill out the form below and our team will get back to you within 24 hours.","nameLabel":"Your name","emailLabel":"Email address","phoneLabel":"Phone (optional)","messageLabel":"Your message","buttonLabel":"Send message","successText":"Thank you! We''ll be in touch soon.","consentText":"I agree to receive a reply to my message.","body_bn":"আমরা আপনার কাছ থেকে শুনতে চাই। নিচের ফর্ম পূরণ করুন, আমাদের দল ২৪ ঘণ্টার মধ্যে যোগাযোগ করবে।","nameLabel_bn":"আপনার নাম","emailLabel_bn":"ইমেইল ঠিকানা","phoneLabel_bn":"ফোন (ঐচ্ছিক)","messageLabel_bn":"আপনার বার্তা","buttonLabel_bn":"বার্তা পাঠান","successText_bn":"ধন্যবাদ! আমরা শীঘ্রই যোগাযোগ করব।","consentText_bn":"আমি আমার বার্তার উত্তর পেতে সম্মত।"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-faq-73","type":"faq","props":{"heading":"","q1":"What are your delivery timelines?","a1":"Orders within Dhaka city are delivered within 24-48 hours. Nationwide deliveries across all 64 districts take 48-72 hours via premium courier.","q2":"Can I exchange an item at a physical store?","a2":"Yes! Any item purchased online can be exchanged at any Framique flagship outlet in Dhaka, Chattogram, or Sylhet within 7 days with the original invoice.","q3":"Are your handloom fabrics pre-shrunk?","a3":"All our pure cotton and silk garments undergo traditional pre-wash finishing. Follow our care guidelines for minimal shrinkage.","q1_bn":"ডেলিভারির সময়সীমা কত?","a1_bn":"ঢাকা সিটির ভেতরে ২৪-৪৮ ঘণ্টার মধ্যে ডেলিভারি দেওয়া হয়। ৬৪ জেলার যেকোনো প্রান্তে প্রিমিয়াম কুরিয়ারের মাধ্যমে ৪৮-৭২ ঘণ্টার মধ্যে পৌঁছে যায়।","q2_bn":"আমি কি সরাসরি আউটলেটে এসে পণ্য বদল করতে পারি?","a2_bn":"হ্যাঁ! অনলাইনে কেনা যেকোনো পণ্য আসল ইনভয়েসসহ ৭ দিনের মধ্যে ঢাকা, চট্টগ্রাম বা সিলেটের যেকোনো ফ্ল্যাগশিপ আউটলেটে বদল করা যাবে।","q3_bn":"আপনাদের তাঁতের কাপড় কি ধোয়ার পর ছোট হয়ে যায়?","a3_bn":"আমাদের শতভাগ সুতি ও সিল্কের পোশাকগুলো ঐতিহ্যবাহী প্রি-ওয়াশ ফিনিশিং করা থাকে। কাপড়ের সুরক্ষায় যত্নের নির্দেশিকা মেনে চলুন।"}},{"id":"clothing-heritage-support-strip-74","type":"support_strip","props":{"heading":"","t1Title":"Order Tracking","t1Body":"Real-time dispatch updates","t1Href":"/pages/track-order","t2Title":"Store Locator","t2Body":"Find your nearest flagship","t2Href":"/pages/stores","t3Title":"Size & Fit Advice","t3Body":"Personal styling helpline","t3Href":"/pages/size-guide","t4Title":"Easy Exchanges","t4Body":"7-day doorstep exchange","t4Href":"/pages/returns","t1Title_bn":"অর্ডার ট্র্যাকিং","t1Body_bn":"রিয়েল-টাইম ডেলিভারি আপডেট","t2Title_bn":"আউটলেট লোকেশন","t2Body_bn":"নিকটস্থ ফ্ল্যাগশিপ আউ